{"version":1,"content":"<p>AMD行政總裁蘇姿豐（Lisa Su）在2026年交出了一份亮眼的成績單。她過去近15年的職業選擇與努力，也在這一年得到了充分體現。蘇姿豐在雅虎財經投資峯會（Yahoo Finance Invest）上表示：「我當初加入AMD，是因為我希望成為一家真正站在技術前沿的公司的成員。我堅信，技術能夠為經濟和世界帶來巨大的積極影響，我希望成為其中的一部分。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586204.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.092989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:55:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"c51e73f7e0c176120703f57196dcfc90aecb76ed8fc3791394f89209dfcd189a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}